cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this study's code in your research, please cite it using the
  metadata below.

title: >
  External Validation of Three Published Integer Risk Scores for Non-Home
  Discharge After Major Lower Extremity Amputation

authors:
  - given-names: "Adam P."
    family-names: "Johnson"
    name-suffix: "MD, MPH"
    affiliation: "Duke University School of Medicine, Department of Surgery"
